<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#000000" />
  <title>Support · NutriQuest</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Get help with NutriQuest. Contact our team at hello@nutriquest.io for questions, feedback, or account support." />
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "SF Pro Text", "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #000;
      color: #f5f5f7;
      line-height: 1.6;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .header {
      padding: 24px 24px 0;
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      width: 100%;
    }
    .brand {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: 20px;
      letter-spacing: -0.3px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #fff;
    }
    .brand-mark {
      width: 32px; height: 32px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b 0%, #a855f7 100%);
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 18px;
    }
    main {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 48px 24px 24px;
      flex: 1;
      width: 100%;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 40px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      line-height: 1.1;
    }
    .lead {
      color: #a1a1aa;
      font-size: 17px;
      margin: 0 0 36px;
      max-width: 560px;
    }
    .card {
      background: #18181b;
      border: 1px solid #27272a;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 28px;
      margin: 0 0 16px;
    }
    .card h2 {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      color: #a1a1aa;
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .email-link {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #f59e0b;
      text-decoration: none;
      letter-spacing: -0.3px;
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 4px 0;
      border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
      transition: border-color 0.15s ease;
    }
    .email-link:hover { border-bottom-color: #f59e0b; }
    .response-note {
      color: #71717a;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin: 12px 0 0;
    }
    .faq-item {
      padding: 14px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #27272a;
    }
    .faq-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .faq-q {
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #f5f5f7;
      font-size: 15px;
      margin: 0 0 4px;
    }
    .faq-a {
      color: #a1a1aa;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin: 0;
    }
    .faq-a a { color: #f59e0b; text-decoration: none; }
    .faq-a a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    footer {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 32px 24px;
      color: #52525b;
      font-size: 13px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
      border-top: 1px solid #18181b;
    }
    footer a {
      color: #71717a;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-right: 16px;
    }
    footer a:hover { color: #f5f5f7; }
    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      h1 { font-size: 32px; }
      main { padding: 32px 20px 16px; }
      .card { padding: 22px; }
      .email-link { font-size: 19px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="header">
    <a href="/" class="brand">
      <span class="brand-mark">⚔️</span>
      NutriQuest
    </a>
  </div>

  <main>
    <h1>Support</h1>
    <p class="lead">Questions, feedback, or account issues? Our team is here to help — we read every message.</p>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <a href="mailto:hello@nutriquest.io" class="email-link">hello@nutriquest.io</a>
      <p class="response-note">We typically reply within 24 hours, Monday–Friday.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Common questions</h2>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <p class="faq-q">How do I delete my account?</p>
        <p class="faq-a">Open the app → Profile tab → Settings → <strong>Delete Account</strong>. This permanently removes all your data within 30 days.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <p class="faq-q">How do I subscribe to Pro or Elite?</p>
        <p class="faq-a">On iPhone, subscriptions are managed at <a href="https://nutriquest.io/subscribe">nutriquest.io/subscribe</a>. Your subscription syncs to the app automatically.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <p class="faq-q">My meal scanner isn't recognising food</p>
        <p class="faq-a">Try good lighting and a clear, top-down photo of the meal. If it persists, email us with a sample photo and we'll investigate.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <p class="faq-q">I'd like a refund</p>
        <p class="faq-a">Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@nutriquest.io">hello@nutriquest.io</a> within 14 days of purchase and we'll process your refund.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <p class="faq-q">Press, partnerships, or B2B</p>
        <p class="faq-a">Same email — pop "Press" or "B2B" in the subject line and we'll get to you fast.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div>© 2026 NutriQuest, Inc.</div>
    <div>
      <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a>
      <a href="/terms">Terms</a>
      <a href="/support">Support</a>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
